# doq-bootstrap: msgid repeated on page, first translation kept
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "How to utilize variational algorithms to solve application use cases\n"
msgstr ""
"Cómo utilizar algoritmos variacionales para resolver casos de uso en "
"aplicaciones\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the Qiskit patterns framework can be applied to all the problems "
"we introduce here. However, to avoid repetition, we will only explicitly "
"call out the framework steps in one example case, run on real hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ten en cuenta que el marco de patrones de Qiskit puede aplicarse a todos los"
" problemas que presentamos aquí. Sin embargo, para evitar repetición, solo "
"mencionaremos explícitamente los pasos del marco en un caso de ejemplo, "
"ejecutado en hardware real.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Problem definitions {#problem-definitions}"
msgstr "Definiciones de problemas {#problem-definitions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Imagine that we want to use a variational algorithm to find the eigenvalue "
"of the following observable:\n"
msgstr ""
"Imagina que queremos usar un algoritmo variacional para encontrar el valor "
"propio del siguiente observable:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_1 = 2 II - 2 XX + 3 YY - 3 ZZ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\hat{O}_1 = 2 II - 2 XX + 3 YY - 3 ZZ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: msgid repeated on page, first translation kept
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This observable has the following eigenvalues:\n"
msgstr "Este observable tiene los siguientes valores propios:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lambda_0 = -6 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_1 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_2 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_3 = 6\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lambda_0 = -6 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_1 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_2 = 4 \\\\\n"
"\\lambda_3 = 6\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: msgid repeated on page, first translation kept
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "And eigenstates:\n"
msgstr "Y los siguientes estados propios:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"|\\phi_0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_2\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle - |10\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_3\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle + |10\\rangle)\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\left\\{\n"
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"|\\phi_0\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_1\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle - |11\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_2\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle - |10\\rangle)\\\\\n"
"|\\phi_3\\rangle = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|01\\rangle + |10\\rangle)\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\right\\}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Custom VQE {#custom-vqe}"
msgstr "VQE personalizado {#custom-vqe}"

