msgid "As you can see, the result is extremely close to the ideal.\n"
msgstr "Como puedes ver, el resultado es extremadamente cercano al ideal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Experimenting to improve speed and accuracy {#experimenting-to-improve-"
