#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add reference state {#add-reference-state}"
msgstr "Agregar estado de referencia {#add-reference-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the previous example we have not used any reference operator $U_R$. Now "
"let us think about how the ideal eigenstate "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)$ can be obtained. Consider "
"the following circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"En el ejemplo anterior no hemos utilizado ningún operador de referencia "
"$U_R$. Ahora pensemos en cómo puede obtenerse el estado propio ideal "
"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(|00\\rangle + |11\\rangle)$. Considera el siguiente "
"circuito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-"
"algorithm-design/examples-and-applications/extracted-"
"outputs/55b26ae7-ad26-4b54-b4f3-2004bb2db0c9-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/variational-"
"algorithm-design/examples-and-applications/extracted-"
"outputs/55b26ae7-ad26-4b54-b4f3-2004bb2db0c9-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We can quickly check that this circuit gives us the desired state.\n"
msgstr ""
